 `Screenshot\\n\\n![image](https://example.com/demo.png)`.\n- This implementation is present in commit `413990c94537e9c9da973bb21a6afcd332400b91`, which is contained in release tag `v2026.5.16` and later.\n\nThe broader native/local DingTalk media-upload work mentioned in the earlier discussion remains separate, but this issue's proposed Markdown syntax support is covered.\n", "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR", "pin": null, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/NousResearch/hermes-agent/issues/comments/4680041660/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "performed_via_github_app": null, "minimized": null}]